	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Der von <persName ref="p4079" cert="high">Zwick</persName> irrtümlich auf den 27. September datierte Brief muß kurz nach seinem Brief vom 20. Februar (<ref target="file10570">Nr. 534</ref>) geschrieben worden sein, vgl. z. B. unten Z. 2-4 mit <ref target="file10570">Nr. 534</ref>, 11; unten Z. 8f mit <ref target="file10570">Nr. 534</ref>, 7f; unten Z. 14-18 mit <ref target="file10570">Nr. 534</ref>, 2-6.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus et pax Christi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Iterum atque etiam experiris, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, suavissime <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>frater, quam sim stupido et oblivioso ingenio: quorsum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>enim, quod nuper tam constanter scripsi me tibi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>remittere consilia<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. oben <ref target="file10570">Nr. 534</ref>, 11.</note>, cum ipsa servaverim domi?</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Ergo si tibet, mendacii me accusa, quanquam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mendatium purgaturus sim ignorantia, quę <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>innata est mihi homini misero.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed iam praesto, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quod pollicebar nuper, nisi iterum excidat, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quominus addam literis consilia.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Hoc ne fiat, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>e naso nodum faciam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">scherzhaft für: sich etwas merken (wofür sonst der Knoten im Taschentuch üblich ist), vgl. <bibl source="b681">Wander</bibl> II 1441: <bibl source="b541">Röhrich</bibl> II 677. I 521.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="120"/><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Deinde ad te mitto responsionem <persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName> ad nos <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>priorem<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Gemeint ist <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> Brief vom 3. Februar an <persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName> und <persName ref="p4079">Johannes Zwick</persName>, vgl. oben <ref target="file10570">Nr. 534</ref>, 7f. Die Abschrift (vgl. unten Z. 33-35) scheint nicht mehr erhalten zu sein.</note>, sed nosti, qua lege, scilicet bonę fidei.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nob <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>enim, quisquam alius legat, cum non omnes sint <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>aequo animo neque irritanda sunt magis atque <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>magis ingenia quorundam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Fingendum esset <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quid potius, quo placarentur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Proinde non omnes <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>cauti sunt in scribendis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">scribendis <hi>korr. aus</hi> scribendo.</note> literis ad amicos.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hinc <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>miscentur vel odiosissima, quaeque non nisi in sinum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>effusa sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName ref="p8178">Thomas</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note> noster <persName ref="p467">Bucerum</persName> deprehendit apud <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosium</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName>. Zur Begegnung von <persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName> und <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> in <placeName ref="l512">Tübingen</placeName> vgl. oben <ref target="file10562">Nr. 526</ref>, Anm. 8.</note>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Egit cum illo multis et strenue.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Quid responsi adtulerit nobis, uno verbo <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>dicam: Dolet hoc unum <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName> nos <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> tam offensos esse consilio suo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="||20"/><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Verum an persuasum sit optimo viro huius modi <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>conatus esse periculosos et parum solidos, non <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>intelligo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Omnino putat se nihil dedisse a <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>scriptura alienum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed quid dicam?</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Articulorum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>summa circumfertur typis excusa<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Ein solcher Druck ließ sich bisher nicht nachweisen. Vgl. unten <ref target="file10661">Nr. 623</ref>, Anm. 57.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quidam <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>blandiuntur, quidam frendunt, et nemo est, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>qui non summę levitatis nos insimulet.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Egregie <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>confirmabuntur sectę; <persName ref="p8441">Schwenckfeldio</persName> duplex <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>cor nascetur, si modo non multi quoque <placeName ref="l1097">Monasteriensibus</placeName><note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">sibus <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>accessuri sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tuum consilium iuncto <lb xml:id="p2z12"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicani</persName> summe placet nostris omnibus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quodsi <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>vobis non ingratam rem fecissem, certe misissem <lb xml:id="p2z14"/><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosio</persName>, sed nolui sine venia.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Unum vero optaremus, ut<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> ut <hi>gestrichenes q.</hi></note> per vos quoque <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>scriberetur <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName> negotium fieri a vestris <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>propter consilia <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> data<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> äußerte seine Kritik an den Gutachten von <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> und <persName ref="p2095">Melanchthon</persName> in seinem Brief an <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> vom 28. März, s. unten <ref target="file10598">Nr. 562</ref>, 104-138.</note>, ne putaret <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>bonus vir nobis tantum<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">tantum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensibus</placeName> hęc minime <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>probari.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Cavendum vero, ne ex vestris literis - <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>quas communi nomine scribendas censemus - quicquam <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>suspicari posset de monitione nostra.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Abstinendum <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>esset ab omni mentione nostrarum literarum, imo <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>nominis nostri.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Possent quoque mitti consilia vestra, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>quo magis intelligeret, quae vestra in hisce <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>concordiis sententia, atque hinc forte min<lb xml:id="p2z26"/>us <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>pergeret in instituto.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z28"/>Speramus vos ita <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>facturos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="||21"/><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Responsio, quam mitto, per pueros descripta <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>parum cohaeret, sed litterae A B C etc. indica<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>bunt ordinem.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Aliis quoque erroribus dabis <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>veniam, neque enim relegi neque cum archetypo <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>contuli.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Facile deprehendetis mentem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z7"/>Quicquid vero tibi boni incident ad hanc <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>concordiam confutandam, cave, ne me <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>lateat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Servet te servator cum <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>tota familia omnibusque fratribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de">27. septem<lb xml:id="p3z11"/>bris<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>irrtümlich statt</hi> februarii, <hi>vgl. Anm. 1.</hi></note> 1535.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z12"/>Tuus atque iterum tuus <persName ref="p4079">Io. Z.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf S. 22:]</note>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>selectissimo <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>meo fratri<lb xml:id="p4z6"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>